# 📊 Capstone 2 — Telco Customer Churn Prediction

## 1. Executive Summary
This project develops a predictive model to identify telecom customers most likely to churn (leave the company).  
By predicting churn, the business can take proactive retention steps, reducing customer loss and improving revenue stability.  

**Goals:**  
- Build models with **recall ≥ 0.70** and **ROC-AUC > 0.75**  
- Provide interpretable insights into factors driving churn  
- Deliver notebooks, reports, and a stakeholder-friendly presentation  

---

